---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
const breadcrumbs=[{label:'Where We Serve',href:'/where-we-serve/'}];
const patterns=[
 {title:'One-City Group',image:images.city,copy:'Useful for clubs, studios, schools, or communities whose travelers can depart together or reach one airport easily.'},
 {title:'Multi-City U.S. Group',image:images.train,copy:'Travelers may begin in different cities and meet at a gateway or destination, with transfers built around a common arrival window.'},
 {title:'Internationally Distributed Group',image:images.heroAlt,copy:'Global communities and businesses can use a destination meeting point and a more structured arrival plan.'}
];
---
<BaseLayout title="U.S.-Based Group Travel Planning for Worldwide Trips | Talon Expeditions" description="Talon Expeditions is a U.S.-based group travel planning company serving clubs, communities, businesses, and private groups across the United States for trips to destinations worldwide." image={images.heroAlt} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <section class="av-inner-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.heroAlt}')`}><div class="shell"><h1>Where We Serve</h1><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="av-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">U.S.-Based Planning · Worldwide Travel</p><h2>National Source Market, Global Delivery</h2></div><p>Talon Expeditions works primarily with U.S.-based organizers and travelers and plans travel to destinations worldwide. Groups can be concentrated in one city or have travelers arriving from multiple states or countries.</p><a class="button button-small" href="/plan-a-trip/">Plan a Worldwide Trip</a></div><div class="av-destination-grid">{patterns.map((item)=><div class="av-destination-card" style={`background-image:url('${item.image}')`}><div class="av-destination-card-top"><span>Source-market pattern</span><span class="av-card-arrow">⌖</span></div><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.copy}</p><div class="av-destination-tags"><span>Group travel</span><span>Arrival planning</span></div></div>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="av-category-stage"><div class="shell av-category-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Destination Operations</p><h2 class="section-title">Worldwide Does Not Mean Generic</h2><p class="av-category-copy">A global planning model only works when local differences are treated seriously.</p><ul class="av-category-menu"><li>Season</li><li>Transport</li><li>Local Operators</li><li>Guides</li><li>Permits</li><li>Activity Rules</li></ul></div><div class="av-category-visual" style={`background-image:url('${images.marrakech}')`}><div class="av-category-caption"><h3>Specific trip design for specific places.</h3><p>Destination pages and trip pages are added when there is enough real information to support them, rather than mass-producing thin location pages.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="av-why-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">U.S. Correspondence</p><h2>One Stable Public Entity Layer</h2></div><p>Travel support can be global while the company information stays consistent and easy to verify.</p></div><div class="av-why-image" style={`background-image:url('${images.road}')`}></div><div class="av-why-grid"><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>Talon Global LLC</h3><span class="num">01</span></div><p>dba Talon Expeditions, the operating company behind the public travel brand.</p></div><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>Miami Beach</h3><span class="num">02</span></div><p>407 Lincoln Rd, Suite 6H166, Miami Beach, Florida 33139, United States.</p></div><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>Phone</h3><span class="num">03</span></div><p><a href="tel:+13057096099">+1 305 709 6099</a></p></div><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>Email</h3><span class="num">04</span></div><p><a href="mailto:sales@talonexpeditions.com">sales@talonexpeditions.com</a></p></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
